    `the transactions have, or are likely to have, the effect of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the price on an organised market` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the transactions have, or are they likely to have, the effect of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the price of the securities or securities-based derivatives contracts on an organised market?
    `the person acted with the intent to induce other persons to subscribe for, purchase or sell securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the business trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person act with the intent to induce other persons to subscribe for, purchase or sell securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the business trust?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198(2) the person's transactions contravene the bar on market manipulation in securities of a business trust` MEANS
    IF (`the number of transactions in securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the business trust that the person effected, took part in, was concerned in or carried out` AT LEAST 2) AND `the transactions have, or are likely to have, the effect of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the price on an organised market` AND `the person acted with the intent to induce other persons to subscribe for, purchase or sell securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of the business trust`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "2 or more transactions in securities" "with the intent to induce other persons" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN]

@ref s 198(2) (src:34421-34430)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 197 to s 203 prohibited act`
`s 198(2) a person must not carry out 2 or more transactions in a business trust's securities with the intent to induce others to deal` MEANS
    PARTY Individual "a person"
    SHANT `s 198(2) effect, take part in or carry out 2 or more transactions in securities of a business trust with the intent to induce others to subscribe for, purchase or sell`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BECAUSE "the person carried out 2 or more transactions in securities of a business trust that affect the price, with the intent to induce others to subscribe for, purchase or sell (section 198(2))"

