    `the act is the making of an offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the act is the making of an offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
    `the act is the making of an invitation, however expressed, that directly or indirectly invites a person to offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the act is the making of an invitation, however expressed, that directly or indirectly invites a person to offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 198(3)(b) the act is within the reference to transactions in securities or securities-based derivatives contracts of a business trust` MEANS
    IF `the act is the making of an offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts` OR `the act is the making of an invitation, however expressed, that directly or indirectly invites a person to offer to purchase or sell such securities or securities-based derivatives contracts`
