§ `s 199: false or misleading statements`

-- src:34469 | 199. A person must not make a statement, or disseminate
-- src:34470 | information, that is false or misleading in a material particular and
-- src:34471 | is likely —
-- src:34473 | (a) to induce other persons to subscribe for securities,
-- src:34474 | securities‑based derivatives contracts or units in a
-- src:34475 | collective investment scheme;
-- src:34477 | (b) to induce the sale or purchase of securities,
-- src:34478 | securities‑based derivatives contracts or units in a
-- src:34479 | collective investment scheme, by other persons; or
-- src:34481 | (c) to have the effect (whether significant or otherwise) of
-- src:34482 | raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the market
-- src:34483 | price of securities, securities‑based derivatives contracts or
-- src:34484 | units in a collective investment scheme,
-- src:34486 | if, when the person makes the statement or disseminates the
-- src:34487 | information —
-- src:34489 | (d) the person does not care whether the statement or
-- src:34490 | information is true or false; or
-- src:34492 | (e) the person knows or ought reasonably to have known that
-- src:34493 | the statement or information is false or misleading in a
-- src:34494 | material particular.
@ref s 199 (src:34469-34494)
GIVEN
    `the person made a statement, or disseminated information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person make a statement, or disseminate information?
    `the statement or information is false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the statement or information false or misleading in a material particular?
    `the statement or information is likely to induce other persons to subscribe for securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the statement or information is likely to induce other persons to subscribe for securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme?
    `the statement or information is likely to induce the sale or purchase of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme by other persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the statement or information is likely to induce the sale or purchase of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme by other persons?
    `the statement or information is likely to have the effect, whether significant or otherwise, of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the market price of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the statement or information is likely to have the effect, whether significant or otherwise, of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the market price of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme?
    `when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person did not care whether it was true or false` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person did not care whether it was true or false?
    `when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person knew or ought reasonably to have known that it was false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person knew or ought reasonably to have known that it was false or misleading in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 199 the person's statement or information contravenes the bar on false or misleading statements` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the person made a statement, or disseminated information` AND `the statement or information is false or misleading in a material particular` AND (`the statement or information is likely to induce other persons to subscribe for securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme` OR `the statement or information is likely to induce the sale or purchase of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme by other persons` OR `the statement or information is likely to have the effect, whether significant or otherwise, of raising, lowering, maintaining or stabilising the market price of securities, securities-based derivatives contracts or units in a collective investment scheme`))
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "that is false or misleading in a material particular and is likely" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN]
        IF `when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person did not care whether it was true or false` OR `when the person made the statement or disseminated the information, the person knew or ought reasonably to have known that it was false or misleading in a material particular`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if, when the person makes the statement or disseminates the information" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [IF]

@ref s 199 (src:34469-34494)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 197 to s 203 prohibited act`
`s 199 a person must not make a false or misleading statement likely to induce dealing or move the price` MEANS
    PARTY Individual "a person"
    SHANT `s 199 make a statement, or disseminate information, that is false or misleading in a material particular`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BECAUSE "the person made a statement or disseminated information that is false or misleading in a material particular, and is likely to induce dealing or move the price (section 199)"

§ `s 200: fraudulently inducing persons to deal in capital markets products`

-- src:34501 | 200.—(1) A person must not —
-- src:34503 | (a) by making or publishing any statement, promise or forecast
-- src:34504 | that the person knows or ought reasonably to have known
-- src:34505 | to be misleading, false or deceptive;
-- src:34507 | (b) by any dishonest concealment of material facts;
-- src:34509 | (c) by the reckless making or publishing of any statement,
-- src:34510 | promise or forecast that is misleading, false or deceptive;
-- src:34511 | or
-- src:34516 | (d) by recording or storing in, or by means of, any mechanical,
-- src:34517 | electronic or other device information that the person
-- src:34518 | knows to be false or misleading in a material particular,
-- src:34520 | induce or attempt to induce another person to deal in capital markets
-- src:34521 | products.
@ref s 200(1) (src:34501-34521)
GIVEN
    `the person induced or attempted to induce another person to deal in capital markets products` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person induce, or attempt to induce, another person to deal in capital markets products?
    `the person made or published a statement, promise or forecast that the person knew or ought reasonably to have known to be misleading, false or deceptive` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person made or published a statement, promise or forecast that the person knew or ought reasonably to have known to be misleading, false or deceptive?
    `the person dishonestly concealed material facts` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person dishonestly conceal material facts?
    `the person recklessly made or published a statement, promise or forecast that is misleading, false or deceptive` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person recklessly made or published a statement, promise or forecast that is misleading, false or deceptive?
    `the person recorded or stored in, or by means of, a mechanical, electronic or other device information that the person knew to be false or misleading in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the person recorded or stored in, or by means of, a mechanical, electronic or other device information that the person knew to be false or misleading in a material particular?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 200(1) the person's conduct contravenes the bar on fraudulently inducing a person to deal` MEANS
    IF `the person induced or attempted to induce another person to deal in capital markets products` AND (`the person made or published a statement, promise or forecast that the person knew or ought reasonably to have known to be misleading, false or deceptive` OR `the person dishonestly concealed material facts` OR `the person recklessly made or published a statement, promise or forecast that is misleading, false or deceptive` OR `the person recorded or stored in, or by means of, a mechanical, electronic or other device information that the person knew to be false or misleading in a material particular`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "induce or attempt to induce another person to deal in capital markets products" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN]

@ref s 200(1) (src:34501-34521)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `s 197 to s 203 prohibited act`
`s 200(1) a person must not fraudulently induce another person to deal in capital markets products` MEANS
    PARTY Individual "a person"
    SHANT `s 200(1) induce or attempt to induce another person to deal in capital markets products by a misleading, false or deceptive statement, a dishonest concealment, or false recorded information`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BECAUSE "the person induced or attempted to induce another person to deal in capital markets products by a misleading statement, a dishonest concealment or false recorded information (section 200(1))"

-- src:34525 | (2) In any proceedings against a person for a contravention of
-- src:34526 | subsection (1) constituted by recording or storing information as
-- src:34527 | mentioned in subsection (1)(d), it is a defence if it is established that,
-- src:34528 | at the time when the defendant so recorded or stored the information,
