    `it is established that when the defendant recorded or stored the information the defendant had no reasonable grounds for expecting that it would be available to any other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it established that, at the time when the defendant recorded or stored the information, the defendant had no reasonable grounds for expecting that the information would be available to any other person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 200(2) the defendant has the defence to a contravention constituted by recording or storing information` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the contravention alleged is constituted by recording or storing information as mentioned in subsection (1)(d)`
        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "constituted by recording or storing information as mentioned in subsection (1)(d)"
        IF `it is established that when the defendant recorded or stored the information the defendant had no reasonable grounds for expecting that it would be available to any other person`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it is a defence if it is established that" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [DEFENCE]

-- src:34532 | (3) In any proceedings against a person for a contravention of
-- src:34533 | subsection (1) in relation to the dealing in capital markets products
-- src:34534 | that are securities, securities‑based derivatives contracts or units in a
-- src:34535 | collective investment scheme, the opinion of any public accountant as
-- src:34536 | to the financial position of any company at any time or during any
