    `the person knowingly executed, or held the person out as having executed, an order for the purchase or sale of a derivatives contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person knowingly execute, or hold the person out as having executed, an order for the purchase or sale of a derivatives contract?
    `the person effected in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person effect in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the order?
    `the person effected in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the business rules and practices of an organised market on which it is to be purchased or sold` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person effect in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the business rules and practices of an organised market on which the derivatives contract is to be purchased or sold?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 201A(1) the person's execution of an order contravenes the bar on bucketing a derivatives contract` MEANS
    IF `the person knowingly executed, or held the person out as having executed, an order for the purchase or sale of a derivatives contract` AND (NOT (`the person effected in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the order` OR `the person effected in good faith a purchase or sale of the derivatives contract in accordance with the business rules and practices of an organised market on which it is to be purchased or sold`))
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "without having effected in good faith a purchase or sale" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN]

@ref s 201A(1) (src:34572-34577)
