    `the person manipulated or attempted to manipulate the price of a derivatives contract traded on an organised market` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person, directly or indirectly, manipulate or attempt to manipulate the price of a derivatives contract traded on an organised market?
    `the person manipulated or attempted to manipulate the price of an underlying thing that is the subject of such a derivatives contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person, directly or indirectly, manipulate or attempt to manipulate the price of an underlying thing that is the subject of such a derivatives contract?
    `the person cornered or attempted to corner an underlying thing that is the subject of a derivatives contract` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the person, directly or indirectly, corner or attempt to corner an underlying thing that is the subject of a derivatives contract?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 201B the person's conduct contravenes the bar on manipulating the price of derivatives contracts and cornering` MEANS
    IF `the person manipulated or attempted to manipulate the price of a derivatives contract traded on an organised market` OR `the person manipulated or attempted to manipulate the price of an underlying thing that is the subject of such a derivatives contract` OR `the person cornered or attempted to corner an underlying thing that is the subject of a derivatives contract`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "manipulate or attempt to manipulate the price of a derivatives contract traded on an organised market" -- SPLIT-SITE (i) [OWN]

